  "rhythm": "Twitch owner credit: Acry. Continuous 19.9-second passage from Songsterr song 7177114, lead-guitar bars 13-22: the recognizable lead phrase continues directly into four bars of the rapid pedal-tone arpeggio and then into the following phrase, with no rests or looped two-bar excerpt. Exact dotted-eighth, eighth and sixteenth durations are retained at 130 BPM. The low Eb pedal was octave-folded upward so the whole uninterrupted passage fits the ocarina, then the builder moved every part down 6 semitones. Bass roots follow the matching bars of the same full-band tab. Songsterr song 2692158 supplies the preferred Symphony of the Night-tagged distortion-guitar, bass and drum reference for the darker backing.",
